    "name": {
      "zh": "Apple iPhone（初代）",
      "en": "Apple iPhone (first generation)"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Apple iPhone 初代是苹果 2007 年发布的智能手机，以 3.5 英寸多点触控屏与无物理键盘重新定义了手机，开启智能手机与触屏革命。",
      "en": "The original Apple iPhone, launched in 2007, redefined the phone with a 3.5-inch multi-touch display and no physical keyboard, igniting the smartphone and touchscreen revolution."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 2007,
    "manufacturer": "Apple",
    "category": "phone",
    "description": "Apple iPhone 初代（2007）：3.5 英寸多点触控屏、ARM11、无物理键盘、EDGE 网络、iPhone OS、内置不可拆卸电池。演示向（无模拟器，iOS 红线）。",
